    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bally Fears: The Paradox \u2013 Exploration, Survival, and Mysteries</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <i>Bally Fears: The Paradox</i>, you play as <strong>Reyes</strong>, a young child around ten years old. His mother has recently passed away, but he doesn't know it yet. His father brought him to his office to protect him. The game begins when he calls you\u2026 to warn you about something.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>An intense psychological survival horror</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Bally Fears: The Paradox</i> is a <strong>narrative-driven survival horror</strong> game combining <strong>exploration, puzzles, and stealth</strong>. Your goal is to navigate an oppressive environment while escaping the creatures that hunt you. As you progress, you must gather clues to uncover the truth behind this nightmare and the strange events surrounding you.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Immersive exploration</strong> \u2013 Interact with your environment, find essential items like keys, access cards\u2026 and that strange eye. Curiosity is your best ally.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Survival-based gameplay</strong> \u2013 You are vulnerable. Hide, run, and find ways to escape the lurking monsters.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A dark and heavy atmosphere</strong> \u2013 They are watching you. They are waiting for the right moment to strike.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Between reality and paradox</strong> \u2013 Your memories blend, your perception deceives you\u2026 What is real, and what is not?</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong> </strong></h2>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bally Fears: The Paradox \u2013 Exploration, Survival, and Mysteries</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <i>Bally Fears: The Paradox</i>, you play as <strong>Reyes</strong>, a young child around ten years old. His mother has recently passed away, but he doesn't know it yet. His father brought him to his office to protect him. The game begins when he calls you\u2026 to warn you about something.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>An intense psychological survival horror</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Bally Fears: The Paradox</i> is a <strong>narrative-driven survival horror</strong> game combining <strong>exploration, puzzles, and stealth</strong>. Your goal is to navigate an oppressive environment while escaping the creatures that hunt you. As you progress, you must gather clues to uncover the truth behind this nightmare and the strange events surrounding you.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Immersive exploration</strong> \u2013 Interact with your environment, find essential items like keys, access cards\u2026 and that strange eye. Curiosity is your best ally.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Survival-based gameplay</strong> \u2013 You are vulnerable. Hide, run, and find ways to escape the lurking monsters.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A dark and heavy atmosphere</strong> \u2013 They are watching you. They are waiting for the right moment to strike.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Between reality and paradox</strong> \u2013 Your memories blend, your perception deceives you\u2026 What is real, and what is not?</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong> </strong></h2>",
